  "releaseNotes": "Kafka: the kafka settings section becomes the same client config through steps, KafkaClassFixture and ToClientConfig. KafkaClassFixture no longer turns off the broker hostname check by itself: if you relied on it, add \"sslEndpointIdentificationAlgorithm\": \"None\". Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
